             <p class=\\\"guru-desc\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Period of struggle against British rule.<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0905\\u0902\\u0917\\u094d\\u0930\\u0947\\u091c\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0935\\u093f\\u0930\\u0941\\u0926\\u094d\\u0927 \\u0938\\u0902\\u0918\\u0930\\u094d\\u0937 \\u0915\\u093e \\u0915\\u093e\\u0932\\u0964<\\\/span><\\\/p>\\n                    <\\\/div>\\n                <\\\/div>\\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row\\\"><div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">35<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\"><span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Shankarananda Tirtha I<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0936\\u0902\\u0915\\u0930\\u093e\\u0928\\u0902\\u0926 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925 (\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0925\\u092e)<\\\/span><\\\/span><span class=\\\"guru-period\\\">1900 - 1925<\\\/span><\\\/div><\\\/div>\\n\\n                <!-- PART 4 -->\\n                <h3 class=\\\"part-heading\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Part 4: Modern Acharyas<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u092d\\u093e\\u0917 4: \\u0906\\u0927\\u0941\\u0928\\u093f\\u0915 \\u090f\\u0935\\u0902 \\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0924\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928 \\u0906\\u091a\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f (1925 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u0905\\u092c \\u0924\\u0915)<\\\/span><\\\/h3>\\n                \\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">36<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Niranjanadeva Tirtha<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0930\\u0902\\u091c\\u0928\\u0926\\u0947\\u0935 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925<\\\/span><\\\/span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"guru-period\\\">1925 - 1955<\\\/span>\\n                        <p class=\\\"guru-desc\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Made significant efforts to re-establish the Peetham's glory in the modern era.<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0906\\u0927\\u0941\\u0928\\u093f\\u0915 \\u092f\\u0941\\u0917 \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092a\\u0940\\u0920 \\u0915\\u094b \\u092a\\u0941\\u0928\\u0903 \\u0938\\u094d\\u0925\\u093e\\u092a\\u093f\\u0924 \\u0915\\u0930\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u093e \\u092d\\u0917\\u0940\\u0930\\u0925 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092f\\u093e\\u0938 \\u0915\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e\\u0964<\\\/span><\\\/p>\\n                    <\\\/div>\\n                <\\\/div>\\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row\\\"><div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">37<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\"><span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Nityananda Tirtha<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0924\\u094d\\u092f\\u093e\\u0928\\u0902\\u0926 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925<\\\/span><\\\/span><span class=\\\"guru-period\\\">1955 - 1970<\\\/span><\\\/div><\\\/div>\\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row\\\"><div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">38<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\"><span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Vishnu Tirtha<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0935\\u093f\\u0937\\u094d\\u0923\\u0941 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925<\\\/span><\\\/span><span class=\\\"guru-period\\\">1970 - 1985<\\\/span><\\\/div><\\\/div>\\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row\\\"><div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">39<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\"><span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Nirmalananda Tirtha<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0930\\u094d\\u092e\\u0932\\u093e\\u0928\\u0902\\u0926 \\u0924\\u0940\\u0930\\u094d\\u0925<\\\/span><\\\/span><span class=\\\"guru-period\\\">1985 - 1992<\\\/span><\\\/div><\\\/div>\\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row\\\"><div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">40<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\"><span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Raghavashram<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0930\\u093e\\u0918\\u0935\\u093e\\u0936\\u094d\\u0930\\u092e<\\\/span><\\\/span><span class=\\\"guru-period\\\">1992 - 1994<\\\/span><\\\/div><\\\/div>\\n\\n                <div class=\\\"guru-row current\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"guru-icon\\\">41<\\\/div><div class=\\\"guru-details\\\">\\n                        <span class=\\\"guru-name-title\\\" style=\\\"color: #E65100;\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">Swami Nischalananda Saraswati<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u093e\\u092e\\u0940 \\u0928\\u093f\\u0936\\u094d\\u091a\\u0932\\u093e\\u0928\\u0902\\u0926 \\u0938\\u0930\\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u0924\\u0940<\\\/span><\\\/span>\\n                        <span class=\\\"guru-period\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">1994 \\u2013 <span class=\\\"en\\\">Present<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0924\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928<\\\/span><\\\/span>\\n                        <p class=\\\"guru-desc\\\" style=\\\"color: #E65100; font-weight: 500;\\\"><span class=\\\"en\\\">The current 41st Jagadguru Shankaracharya. He has continuously guided the nation and awakened spiritual consciousness across India.<\\\/span><span class=\\\"hi\\\">\\u092f\\u0947 \\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0924\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928 (41\\u0935\\u0947\\u0902) \\u091c\\u0917\\u0926\\u094d\\u0917\\u0941\\u0930\\u0941 \\u0936\\u0902\\u0915\\u0930\\u093e\\u091a\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902\\u0964 30 \\u091c\\u0942\\u0928 1994 \\u0915\\u094b \\u0907\\u0928\\u0915\\u093e \\u092a\\u0926\\u093e\\u0930\\u094b\\u0939\\u0923 \\u0939\\u0941\\u0906\\u0964 \\u0905\\u092c \\u0924\\u0915 \\u092f\\u0947 \\u0932\\u0917\\u093e\\u0924\\u093e\\u0930 \\u0907\\u0938 \\u092a\\u0940\\u0920 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u092e\\u0941\\u0916 \\u092c\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0939\\u0941\\u090f \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902 \\u0914\\u0930 \\u0907\\u0928\\u094d\\u0939\\u094b\\u0902\\u0928\\u0947 \\u092a\\u0942\\u0930\\u0947 \\u092d\\u093e\\u0930\\u0924 \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u0927\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092e\\u093f\\u0915 \\u091a\\u0947\\u0924\\u0928\\u093e \\u091c\\u093e\\u0917\\u0943\\u0924 \\u0915\\u0930\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u093e \\u092e\\u0939\\u093e\\u0928 \\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\u094d\\u092f \\u0915\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964<\\\/span><\\\/p>\\n                    <\\\/div>\\n                <\\\/div>\\n\\n            <\\\/div>\\n        <\\\/div>\\n\\n    <\\\/article>\\n\\n    <!-- Language Switcher Script -->\\n    <script>\\n        function changeLanguage(lang) {\\n            document.body.setAttribute('data-lang', lang);\\n            document.getElementById('btn-en').classList.remove('active');\\n            document.getElementById('btn-hi').classList.remove('active');\\n            document.getElementById('btn-' + lang).classList.add('active');\\n        }\\n    <\\\/script>\\n<\\\/body>\\n<\\\/html>\\n\",\"custom_css\":\"\\\/* PURI GOVARDHAN THEME VARIABLES *\\\/\\n:root {\\n    --bg-color: #FFFDF5; \\n    --puri-orange: #E65100; \\\/* Deep Saffron\\\/Orange *\\\/\\n    --puri-gold: #F39C12; \\\/* Golden Yellow *\\\/\\n    --gold-accent: #B9770E;\\n    --text-dark: #3E2723;\\n    --text-light: #5D6D7E;\\n    --box-bg: #FFFFFF;\\n}\\n\\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\\n\\nbody {\\n    background-color: var(--bg-color); \\n    color: var(--text-dark); \\n    font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; \\n    line-height: 1.8; \\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* Background Pattern *\\\/\\n.bg-pattern {\\n    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; \\n    background-image: radial-gradient(var(--puri-gold) 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); \\n    background-size: 30px 30px; opacity: 0.1; z-index: -1;\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* LANGUAGE SWITCHER *\\\/\\nbody[data-lang=\\\"en\\\"] .hi { display: none !important; }\\nbody[data-lang=\\\"hi\\\"] .en { display: none !important; }\\n\\n.lang-switcher {\\n    position: absolute; top: 30px; right: 5%; z-index: 1000;\\n    display: flex; gap: 5px; background: #fff; padding: 5px;\\n    border-radius: 30px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\\n    border: 2px solid var(--puri-gold);\\n}\\n.lang-btn {\\n    background: transparent; border: none; padding: 6px 15px;\\n    border-radius: 20px; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;\\n    color: var(--puri-orange); cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s;\\n}\\n.lang-btn.active {\\n    background: var(--puri-orange); color: #fff;\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* HERO SECTION *\\\/\\n.profile-hero {\\n    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center; \\n    padding: 100px 5% 50px; gap: 50px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-text-col { flex: 1; min-width: 350px; }\\n.peeth-tag {\\n    display: inline-block; color: var(--puri-orange); font-weight: 700; \\n    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.9rem; \\n    margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--puri-gold); padding-bottom: 5px;\\n}\\n.main-title {\\n    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.8rem); \\n    color: var(--puri-orange); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 15px;\\n}\\n.sub-title { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 30px; }\\n\\n\\\/* Info Grid *\\\/\\n.info-grid {\\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr)); \\n    gap: 15px; margin-top: 30px;\\n}\\n.info-item {\\n    background: var(--box-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--puri-gold); \\n    padding: 15px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(230, 81, 0, 0.08); border-radius: 5px;\\n}\\n.info-label {\\n    font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-light); \\n    letter-spacing: 1px; display: block;\\n}\\n.info-val {\\n    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--puri-orange); font-weight: 700;\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* IMAGE COL *\\\/\\n.hero-image-col { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; max-width: 450px; text-align: center; }\\n.portrait-frame {\\n    padding: 15px; background: var(--box-bg); border-radius: 15px; \\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(230, 81, 0, 0.15); border: 2px solid var(--puri-gold);\\n}\\n.main-img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 10px; display: block; }\\n.img-caption {\\n    text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--puri-orange), var(--puri-gold)); \\n    color: #fff; padding: 10px; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 15px; border-radius: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* CONTENT BODY *\\\/\\n.content-container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px; padding: 0 25px; }\\n\\n.chapter-heading {\\n    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--puri-orange); \\n    margin: 50px 0 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.part-heading {\\n    font-family: 'Alegreya', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; \\n    background: var(--puri-orange); padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: 5px; \\n    margin: 30px 0 15px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* GURU PARAMPARA LIST *\\\/\\n.guru-row {\\n    display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; padding: 12px 0; \\n    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);\\n}\\n.guru-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\\n\\n.guru-icon {\\n    flex-shrink: 0; width: 45px; height: 45px; border: 2px solid var(--puri-gold); \\n    border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; \\n    font-weight: 700; color: var(--puri-orange); background: #FFF8F0; \\n    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1em;\\n}\\n\\n.guru-details { flex-grow: 1; }\\n.guru-name-title { font-size: 1.15em; color: var(--puri-orange); font-weight: 700; display: block; }\\n.guru-period { display: block; font-size: 0.85em; color: #888; margin-top: 2px; }\\n.guru-desc { font-size: 0.95em; color: #555; margin-top: 5px; }\\n\\n\\\/* Highlight Current Acharya *\\\/\\n.guru-row.current {\\n    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(230, 81, 0, 0.1), transparent); \\n    border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--puri-gold);\\n}\\n.guru-row.current .guru-icon {\\n    background: var(--puri-gold); color: #fff; border-color: var(--puri-gold);\\n}\\n\\n\\\/* MEDIA QUERIES *\\\/\\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\\n    .profile-hero { flex-direction: column-reverse; text-align: center; padding-top: 90px; }\\n    .hero-image-col { width: 100%; }\\n    .lang-switcher { top: 20px; right: 50%; transform: translateX(50%); }\\n}\\n\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"_elementor_page_settings","meta_value":"a:0:{}"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_og_content_image","meta_value":"a:2:{s:5:\"check\";s:32:\"fc4dc5baa35f3b7839678804a65f2e0b\";s:6:\"images\";a:1:{i:0;i:50;}}"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_internal_links_processed","meta_value":"1"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_seo_score","meta_value":"57"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_focus_keyword","meta_value":"Govardhan Math Puri"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_title","meta_value":"Govardhan Math Puri | Purvamnaya Peeth | ShivBodh Trust"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_description","meta_value":"Discover Govardhan Math in Puri, the eastern Amnaya Peeth founded by Adi Shankaracharya and its role in Sanatana Dharma."},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"rank_math_analytic_object_id","meta_value":"13"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"_elementor_migrations_state_d2a1","meta_value":"4.2.4:7648e729aae38c0825752571ace57347"},{"post_id":70,"meta_key":"_wp_page_template","meta_value":"page-templates\/template-peetham.php"}]